{"id":4102,"name":"Cleansing Felwood","level":55,"requiredLevel":48,"side":"Horde","typeTag":null,"locationKind":"zone","locationName":"Felwood","locationContinent":"kalimdor","locationZoneId":361,"xp":5650,"money":0,"choiceRewards":[],"guaranteedRewards":[],"textSource":"cmangos","classicXp":null,"classRestriction":null,"difficultyBands":[{"color":"red","level":48},{"color":"orange","level":51},{"color":"yellow","level":53},{"color":"green","level":58}],"repeatable":false,"timelimit":null,"profession":null,"shareable":"Yes","status":"unchanged","statusNote":"Unchanged in Forever as far as is known: the text, objectives and rewards below are Classic’s.","footerSourceNote":"Text, givers, objectives and rewards come from the cMaNGOS Classic database (a reconstruction of the 1.12 world), with what Forever changed on top: the game server’s own answers where we have them, else Wowhead’s Forever database. Places are Classic’s, shown on the Forever maps. Quest text © Blizzard Entertainment.","narrative":{"details":"Plants give life to Felwood, yet even they suffer the taint of corruption.  I know ways to cleanse them, but I cannot give out such knowledge to those I don't know or trust.  Prove to me that you will truly aid the cause of the Cenarion Circle!\n\nTo the north lie the Irontree Caverns.  The Warpwood elementals present there are now beyond hope of cleansing.  I ask you to bring me their sap - blood amber it is called - so I may study it in the hopes of saving other forms of life here.","objectives":"Bring 15 Blood Amber to Maybess Riverbreeze in Felwood.","offerRewardText":"This blood amber will be used to find a means of defeating the corruption present in Felwood.  You've proven to me that you're willing to do whatever it takes for the Cenarion Circle.  I trust you now, friend.\n\nIt might seem odd that killing the elementals proved yourself to me, but the end of saving countless sentient beings must justify the means we take.  You and I can now focus on the preservation of life through the salves I can make.\n\nadventurer, the time has come to cleanse Felwood.","requestItemsText":"I know Felwood suffers, adventurer - I suffer along with it!  I must remain steadfast in my conviction; were the knowledge I possess to fall into the wrong hands, it would spell disaster for all of Felwood.\n\nBring to me the blood amber drawn from the slain Warpwood elementals, and I will trust you enough to help me enact a means to fight the corruption.","endText":null,"objectiveText":[]},"narrativeSource":"cmangos","prevQuest":null,"nextQuest":{"id":5887,"name":"Salve via Hunting"},"nextQuestInChain":null,"giverName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","turnInName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","startItemText":null,"startNpcs":[{"name":"Maybess Riverbreeze","zone":"Felwood","x":46.7,"y":83.1}],"endNpcs":[{"name":"Maybess Riverbreeze","zone":"Felwood","x":46.7,"y":83.1}],"reputation":[],"mentionedItems":[],"mapGroups":[{"zoneId":361,"zoneName":"Felwood","continent":"kalimdor","imageUrl":"/images/zone-maps/361.jpg","markers":[{"kind":"start","npcName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","xPct":46.7,"yPct":83.1},{"kind":"end","npcName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","xPct":46.7,"yPct":83.1}]}],"chain":{"subtitle":"11 quests at level 55, 26,650 XP in all.","steps":[{"stepNumber":1,"isCurrentStep":true,"quests":[{"questId":4102,"name":"Cleansing Felwood","isCurrent":true,"level":"55","objectiveText":"Bring 15 Blood Amber to Maybess Riverbreeze in Felwood.","giverName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","giverZone":"Felwood","xpText":"5,650 XP","rewardItem":{"itemId":null,"href":null,"icon":"","name":null,"quality":null,"qty":1},"variants":null}]},{"stepNumber":2,"isCurrentStep":false,"quests":[{"questId":5887,"name":"Salve via Hunting","isCurrent":false,"level":"55","objectiveText":null,"giverName":"Maybess Riverbreeze","giverZone":"Felwood","xpText":"4,200 XP","rewardItem":{"itemId":11516,"href":"/item/11516","icon":"inv_drink_17","name":"Cenarion Plant Salve","quality":null,"qty":1},"variants":null},{